@MyPanelExpress_HostAddress = http://localhost:5196

### Connexion de l'administrateur
# @name login
POST {{MyPanelExpress_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mypanelexpress.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Utilisateur authentifié
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

GET {{MyPanelExpress_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Formulaire de contact (public)
POST {{MyPanelExpress_HostAddress}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Ahmed Ben Ali",
  "societe": "Enseignes du Sud",
  "telephone": "0612345678",
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "sujet": "Demande de devis",
  "message": "Bonjour, je souhaite un devis pour 3 panneaux rigides 2x1m."
}
